{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06066","headline":"三月三日曲江侍宴应制 · 王维","name":"三月三日曲江侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万乘亲斋祭，千官喜豫游。\n奉迎从上苑，祓禊向中流。\n草树连容衞，山河对冕旒。\n画旗摇浦漵，春服满汀洲。\n仙籞龙媒下，神臯凤跸留。\n从今亿万岁，天宝纪春秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}